#40202
A Storage Chamber~
   This storage room is actually a wine cellar, packed to the roof with large
brown barrels and smaller black tuns of wine and spirits.  Far too large to
shift without a considerable force of laborers, they are all marked with a bung
seal impressed with a death's head, which may well be an indication of the
strength of this alcohol.  Strange glyphs similar to those outside mark the
sides.  Whoever owns these alcoholic brews, they certainly aren't giants.    
