are piles of fungus present, arranged as beds by the odiferous troglodytes that
now lair within.  Hated and feared by the orcs to the south, they have become
trapped here, and are biding their time until they can make a break for it,
fleeing the dungeon altogether.  The cave continues to the northwest, and in
