Climbing the Stair~
   A stiff breeze catches at you as you warily climb the stone steps, and more
than once you slip and almost tumble back down.  The steps are worn smooth by
decades of use, and you wonder how many doughty souls before you have attempted
a crusade against these foul beasts, only to perish deep in their foul lair.  
Who knows what dangers may lie within the dark wooden keep atop the hill?    
